OL,3,GNEWSAFinal testing complete on new
OL,4,AMetro fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll of Tyne and Wear's new fleet of
OL,7,FMetro trains are ready for carry
OL,8,Fpassengers, after undergoing thousands
OL,9,Fof hours of testing.
OL,11,FStadler, the Swiss train manufacturer,
OL,12,Fhave formally handed over the 46th and
OL,13,Ffinal Class 555 to operator Nexus, two
OL,14,Fmonths ahead of the target deadline at
OL,15,Fthe end of the year.
OL,17,FThe final phase of the #362m project
OL,18,Finvolved 90,000 individual tests across
OL,19,Fthe new fleet, with trains undergoing
OL,20,F22,990 miles (37,000 kilometres) of
OL,21,Fon-track test runs, alongside the
OL,22,Ftraining of 480 employees.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
